{
	"$comment": [
		"Curated licence facts for every third-party artifact OmniSign distributes.",
		"Consumed by the root :generateThirdPartyNotices task, which fails the build when a",
		"resolved artifact matches no entry here - so a dependency bump cannot silently ship",
		"an undocumented licence.",
		"",
		"Matching precedence: 'artifacts' (exact group:name) wins over 'groups' (whole group).",
		"'npmPackages' matches entries from the Wasm lockfile, which the web bundle ships.",
		"'license' refers to a key in the licenses map. 'election' records which branch of a",
		"multi-licensed component OmniSign takes, and why."
	],

